&#x02212;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02212;&#x0002f;&#x02212;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02212;&#x0002f;&#x02212;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x0002b;&#x0002f;&#x02212;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x0002b;&#x0002f;&#x02212;</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Microdeletion<sup>f</sup> large<sup>g</sup></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">72</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x0002b;&#x0002f;&#x0002b;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02212;&#x0002f;&#x02212;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02212;&#x0002f;&#x02212;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x0002b;&#x0002f;&#x0002b;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x0002b;&#x0002f;&#x0002b;</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Microdeletion</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">88</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x0002b;&#x0002f;&#x02212;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02212;&#x0002f;&#x02212;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02212;&#x0002f;&#x02212;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x0002b;&#x0002f;&#x02212;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x0002b;&#x0002f;&#x02212;</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Microdeletion<sup>f</sup> Large<sup>g</sup></td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="t5-fn1"><label/><p>Abbreviations: BAC, bacterial artificial chromosome; FISH, fluorescence <italic>in situ</italic> hybridisation.</p></fn><fn id="t5-fn2"><label/><p>The summarised FISH analysis described the findings from the largest clonal cell population.</p></fn><fn id="t5-fn3"><label/><p>&#x0002b;&#x0002f;&#x0002b; no copy change; &#x0002b;&#x0002f;&#x02212; hemizygous deletion; &#x02212;&#x0002f;&#x02212; homozygous deletion.</p></fn><fn id="t5-fn4"><label/><p>Estimated microdeletion: &#x0223c;200&#x02009;kb.</p></fn><fn id="t5-fn5"><label/><p>Estimated small deletion: &#x0223c;7&#x02013;8&#x02009;Mb.</p></fn><fn id="t5-fn6"><label/><p>Estimated large deletion: &#x0223c;19&#x02013;21&#x02009;Mb.</p></fn><fn id="t5-fn7"><label>a</label><p>10q23.2 (88.2&#x02013;88.6&#x02009;Mb).</p></fn><fn id="t5-fn8"><label>b</label><p>10q23.2 (89.4&#x02013;89.5&#x02009;Mb).</p></fn><fn id="t5-fn9"><label>c</label><p><italic>PTEN</italic> locus (89.6&#x02013;89.7&#x02009;Mb).</p></fn><fn id="t5-fn10"><label>d</label><p>10q23.33 (96.2&#x02013;96.6&#x02009;Mb).</p></fn><fn id="t5-fn11"><label>e</label><p>10q25.1 (108.9&#x02013;109.3&#x02009;Mb).</p></fn><fn id="t5-fn12"><label>f</label><p>First event.</p></fn><fn id="t5-fn13"><label>g</label><p>Second event.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>